{"page":20021,"part":1,"text":"节制章第十\n\n\n节制章第十\n\n夫学书作字之体，须遵正法。字之形势不得上宽下窄（如是则是头轻尾重，不相胜任）。不宜伤密，密则似疴瘵缠身（不舒展也），复不宜伤疏，疏则似溺水之禽（诸处伤慢）。不宜伤长，长则似死蛇挂树（腰枝无力）。不宜伤短，短则似踏死蛤蟆（言其阔也）。此乃大忌，可不慎欤!","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20021,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"4fb14d59a0415784942911f2cc8d1545242ea79d6aac1c5e400bb2e64bcc8d1a","textSha256":"4fb14d59a0415784942911f2cc8d1545242ea79d6aac1c5e400bb2e64bcc8d1a","fileSha256":"4fb14d59a0415784942911f2cc8d1545242ea79d6aac1c5e400bb2e64bcc8d1a","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20021-work-021.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"笔势论十二章 并序 · 节制章第十","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/7wKzKkqEtPksjBUcmK1gfa","originalPages":[47],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":6,"sourceTextSha256":"154ff595be0ad5ec892ff705cf2624e7eae8bbb5836a671d3457991e867e4df5","id":"local-47-88-100","page_id":47,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":88,"rawEnd":100,"reviewedTextSha256":"5dc4e497b8ea199ad838d3ce8141dbcfcacc228f6b0ffa380ff291a82b9c2ded","displayUnitOrigins":[[94,95],[95,96],[96,97],[97,98],[98,99],[99,100]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":47,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T07:54:37.660Z","revision":"5dc4e497b8ea199ad838d3ce8141dbcfcacc228f6b0ffa380ff291a82b9c2ded","textSha256":"5dc4e497b8ea199ad838d3ce8141dbcfcacc228f6b0ffa380ff291a82b9c2ded","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":8,"end":13,"sourceTextSha256":"89f6e658d382a52f2